From: Data-crea <sattler.daniel@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:24:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Open fix 5: Race_Selection_Screen_ records _old_race
 (racesel.cpp)

OrionLayer's open fix 5, the racesel.lbx [entry 138] crash on Custom
Race Accept: one line, _old_race = static_cast<int16_t>(i).

Committed as found (OrionLayer work order 126, part A).

Ported onto orion2re v2.0.0 in scratch (work order 242 e) from local 6598052c:
by hand: merge-file placed the line in v2's restructured lastrace.rac path; put after strlcpy in the stock-race custom_flag branch before Racial_Option_Screen (v2 still lacks it there; Draw_Flag_Screen still reads old_race at racesel.cpp:837).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/game/racesel.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/game/racesel.cpp b/src/game/racesel.cpp
index b7640c97..5b232475 100755
--- a/src/game/racesel.cpp
+++ b/src/game/racesel.cpp
@@ -318,6 +318,7 @@ namespace RACESEL {
                             struct_::Copy_Structure(plr->traits, race_specials[i], sizeof(plr->traits));
                             plr->race = (uint8_t)i;
                             strlcpy(plr->race_name, MOX::race_names[i], sizeof(plr->race_name));
+                            old_race = static_cast<int16_t>(i);
                             fields::Deactivate_Auto_Function();
                             fields::Clear_Fields();
                             if (Racial_Option_Screen(plr) == 1) {
